#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rst:2
msgid "rcummax"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:1
msgid ""
"Returns the reversely cumulative max of elements of ``x`` in the "
"dimension ``dim``."
msgstr "次元 ``dim`` における ``x`` の要素の逆方向累積最大値を返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:4
msgid ""
"This is the reverse-direction counterpart of :func:`torch.cummax`: the "
":math:`i`-th output element is the maximum of all elements at or after "
"position :math:`i` along the dimension, together with the index of the "
"first position achieving that maximum.  This is useful, for example, to "
"find the highest future price at each time step."
msgstr ""
"これは :func:`torch.cummax` の逆方向版です。:math:`i` 番目の出力要素は、次元に沿って位置 :math:`i` "
"以降にあるすべての要素の最大値と、その最大値を最初に達成する位置のインデックスです。これは、例えば各時点における将来の最高価格を求めるのに有用です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:11
msgid "The input tensor."
msgstr "入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:14
msgid "The dimension along which to compute the reversely cumulative max."
msgstr "逆方向累積最大値を計算する次元。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:18
msgid ""
"A named tuple of ``(values, indices)``:      - ``values`` (Tensor): A "
"tensor of the same shape as the input,       where each element is the "
"maximum of the input elements at or       after its position along the "
"dimension.     - ``indices`` (Tensor): The index of the first occurrence "
"of       each maximum value along the dimension."
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:20
msgid "A named tuple of ``(values, indices)``:"
msgstr "``(values, indices)`` の名前付きタプル:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:22
msgid ""
"``values`` (Tensor): A tensor of the same shape as the input, where each "
"element is the maximum of the input elements at or after its position "
"along the dimension."
msgstr "``values`` (Tensor): 入力と同じ形状のテンソルで、各要素は次元に沿ってその位置以降にある入力要素の最大値です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:25
msgid ""
"``indices`` (Tensor): The index of the first occurrence of each maximum "
"value along the dimension."
msgstr "``indices`` (Tensor): 次元に沿って各最大値が最初に現れる位置のインデックス。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:30
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:32
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> result = QF.rcummax(x, dim=0)\n"
">>> result.values\n"
"tensor([5., 5., 5., 5., 4.])\n"
">>> result.indices\n"
"tensor([3, 3, 3, 3, 4])"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> result = QF.rcummax(x, dim=0)\n"
">>> result.values\n"
"tensor([5., 5., 5., 5., 4.])\n"
">>> result.indices\n"
"tensor([3, 3, 3, 3, 4])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:39
msgid ""
"NaN values propagate in the direction of accumulation: because the "
"accumulation runs from the end of the dimension, all positions at or "
"before a NaN become NaN."
msgstr "NaN 値は累積の方向に伝播します。累積は次元の末尾から実行されるため、NaN と同じ位置およびそれより前のすべての位置が NaN になります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:44
msgid ":func:`rcumsum`: Reversely cumulative sum function."
msgstr ":func:`rcumsum`: 逆方向の累積和関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:45
msgid ":func:`mmax`: Moving maximum function."
msgstr ":func:`mmax`: 移動最大値関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rcummax.rcummax:46
msgid "``torch.cummax``: Standard (forward) cumulative maximum."
msgstr "``torch.cummax``: 標準の（順方向の）累積最大値。"

